  1 | chain 2 "Tiers"
  2 | strip #1 "Bounce"
  3 |   eq #2
  4 |   -- E214: a render runs in a bake job, not as an insert
  5 |   render #3
    |   ^ 5:3: error E214: `render` runs in tier bake, so it cannot be an insert, which runs live: make it a `producer` line and store its output in a lane with `=>`
  6 |   -- fine: a converter runs live
  7 |   mono #4
  8 | producer render #5
  9 | producer midi-keys #6
 10 | producer avatar #7
 11 | "Room" -> #1
 12 | "Room" -> #5
 13 | -- E215: a live wire from a producer of tier bake into a strip
 14 | #5 -> #1
    | ^ 14:1: error E215: `#5` runs in tier bake, so a live wire cannot leave it: store its output in a lane with `=>`, and wire the lane
 15 | -- fine: its output goes to a lane
 16 | #5 => "Print"
 17 | -- fine: a live wire between two producers that do not run live
 18 | "Notes" -> #6
 19 | #6 -> #7
 20 | #7 => "Avatar"
